<title>USA: Guilford Phase II Dopascan trial positive.</title>
<headline>Guilford Phase II Dopascan trial positive.</headline>
<dateline>BALTIMORE 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Guilford Pharmaceuticals Inc said Monday that the analysis of a Phase IIB multi-center clinical study of Dopascan Injection demonstrated positive results.</p>
<p>Based on the findings, the company is moving ahead with plans to conduct Phase III clinical trials, it said.</p>
<p>According to Guilford, Dopascan is the first diagnostic test being developed for Parkinson's disease, a common neurodegenerative disorder.</p>
</text>
